    "body": "**Problem:** The migration test skips the warning check if `listwalletdir` omits the wallet.\nIt also skips the check for `path/to/trailing/` because the listed name has no trailing separator.\nAfter migration, the backup check compares a name-only dictionary with entries that also contain a `warnings` field, so it passes even if the backup is listed.\n\n**Fix:** Require the legacy wallet and its warning before migration, then check that the backup filename is absent from the listing afterward.\n\n**Mutation tests:** To test each change, apply the mutation and run `wallet_migration.py`.\n",
