        }
      ],
      "message": "test: require the legacy wallet and its migration warning\n\nIf `listwalletdir` omits the wallet, the loop never checks its warning and the test passes.\nThe loop also skips `path/to/trailing/` because the listed name has no trailing separator.\n\nMatch the wallet by its listed name and require the migration warning.\nWith the following mutation, the original test passes and the new check fails because `basic0` is missing.\n\n```sh\nsed -zi 's/ *paths\\.emplace_back(path, \"bdb\");\\n//' src/wallet/db.cpp\n```",
