      "message": "test: check that `listwalletdir` omits migration backups\n\nEvery wallet returned by `listwalletdir` has a `warnings` field, so checking that `{\"name\": backup_filename}` is absent passes even when the backup is listed.\nCompare the backup filename with the listed names instead.\n\nRemoving the `.bak` filter makes `listwalletdir` return the backup, which the previous test accepts and the new check catches.\n\n```sh\nsed -i 's/ && it->path().extension() != \"\\.bak\"//' src/wallet/db.cpp\n```",
